  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Omni Brasil: Microfinance Domestic Bond in Brazil</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This transaction consists of the purchase of a series of R$200 million (~US$38 million), within the public issue of Letras Financeiras thatOMNI S.A. Cr&#xe9;dito, Financiamento e Investimento (&#x201c;Omni&#x201d;) offered to the market for R$500 million (~US$95 million), the remaining R$300 million of which were distributed among Brazilian investors. The average term of the IDB Invest series will be 3.25 years, while the term of the retail series will betwo years.The resources will be used to finance credits granted by Omni in projects aimed at the low-income population, which are self-employed drivers who seek to finance a vehicle as a productive asset.</narrative>
  </description>
